   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "0WJAANnWnRvNk1lgBOio",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1128,
   "y": 1898.75,
   "width": 1020.0,
   "height": 212.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1072699815,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 840110034,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1761100000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Reliability\n• Spot 2-min notice: Interruption Handler drains the node; AI jobs resume from the Checkpoint Store.\n• A graceful Spot interruption does not count as a failure; only real infra failures\n  count, max 3 retries → Dead Letter Queue + alert.\n• Student OOM / timeout is a grade, never retried.\n• Submissions DB: Multi-AZ standby with synchronous replication and automatic failover\n  (SPOF mitigated); sharding by course_id limits the blast radius.\n• Spot capacity Circuit Breaker: an instance type/AZ without capacity is skipped for 15 min.\n• LLM calls: Prompt Injection Guard → Rate Limiter → Circuit Breaker; Response Cache;\n  output validated against a JSON Schema.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "Bf2BM4uc0t00vWzb2am1",
   "originalText": "Reliability\n• Spot 2-min notice: Interruption Handler drains the node; AI jobs resume from the Checkpoint Store.\n• A graceful Spot interruption does not count as a failure; only real infra failures\n  count, max 3 retries → Dead Letter Queue + alert.\n• Student OOM / timeout is a grade, never retried.\n• Submissions DB: Multi-AZ standby with synchronous replication and automatic failover\n  (SPOF mitigated); sharding by course_id limits the blast radius.\n• Spot capacity Circuit Breaker: an instance type/AZ without capacity is skipped for 15 min.\n• LLM calls: Prompt Injection Guard → Rate Limiter → Circuit Breaker; Response Cache;\n  output validated against a JSON Schema.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "Uz1f1JBN07ZoKBRuG2cp",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 2220,
